<!---->
          <h2 class="core-section-container__title section-title">
            About us
          </h2>

<!---->
      <div class="core-section-container__content break-words">
        

          <p class="break-words text-color-text" data-test-id="about-us__description">
              Square Global Markets offers tailored solutions to its clients across multiple products. Including cash equities, ETFs, and vanilla/exotic equity derivatives.

With our extensive network of investment banks and market-makers, we are able to provide our clients with the best service, pricing, liquidity, and execution through a multitude of listed and OTC markets.

Our depth of product knowledge, analytical capabilities and execution facilities positions Square Global Markets as a unique partner. We help our clients meet their growing investment goals and regulatory requirements through innovative product solutions, and offer complete transparency across the execution cycle. 

Our partners have more than 100 years' combined experience in top-tier investment banks and interdealer brokerage firms. We continuously strive to provide best-in-class solutions to our clients through technological innovation and expert analysis.
          </p>

